{"name":"Forget-Me-Not","hex":"#0087bd","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"forget-me-not","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Any of the flowering plants of the genus Myosotis, mostly with a small five-petalled blue flower; a flower from such a plant.","Any of certain species of genus Cynoglossum"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/forget-me-not"}],"entries":[{"title":"Forget-Me-Not (Family Guy)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Forget-Me-Not\" is the seventeenth episode of the tenth season of the animated comedy series Family Guy, and the 182nd episode overall. The episode originally aired on Fox in the United States on March 18, 2012. In this episode, Peter, Joe, Quagmire and Brian wake up in the hospital and realize their memories have been erased and the city of Quahog has been deserted."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Forget-Me-Not_(Family_Guy)","wikidata":"Q5863860"},{"title":"Myosotis","blocks":[{"text":"Myosotis is a genus of flowering plants in the borage family Boraginaceae. In the Northern Hemisphere, they are colloquially known as forget-me-nots or scorpion grasses. The forget-me-not is the official flower of Alaska."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/eb/Myosotis_arvensis_ois.JPG/330px-Myosotis_arvensis_ois.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Myosotis","wikidata":"Q147149"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/eb/Myosotis_arvensis_ois.JPG/500px-Myosotis_arvensis_ois.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/eb/Myosotis_arvensis_ois.JPG/1280px-Myosotis_arvensis_ois.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/eb/Myosotis_arvensis_ois.JPG/500px-Myosotis_arvensis_ois.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedi